          "start": 750.92,
          "end": 751.3,
          "speaker": "Gatut"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "You know, because...",
      "start": 751.4,
      "end": 752.12,
      "speaker": "Gatut",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " You",
          "start": 751.4,
          "end": 751.4,
          "speaker": "Gatut"
        },
        {
          "word": " know,",
          "start": 751.4,
          "end": 751.58,
          "speaker": "Gatut"
        },
        {
          "word": " because...",
          "start": 751.66,
          "end": 752.12,
          "speaker": "Gatut"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "It's like, you know, a very, very savage beast.",
      "start": 752.24,
      "end": 755.6,
      "speaker": "Gatut",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " It's",
          "start": 752.24,
          "end": 752.38,
          "speaker": "Gatut"
        },
        {
          "word": " like,",
          "start": 752.38,
          "end": 752.58,
          "speaker": "Gatut"
        },
        {
          "word": " you",
          "start": 752.82,
          "end": 752.84,
          "speaker": "Gatut"
        },
        {
          "word": " know,",
          "start": 752.84,
          "end": 753.14,
          "speaker": "Gatut"
        },
        {
          "word": " a",
          "start": 753.14,
          "end": 753.14,
          "speaker": "Gatut"
        },
        {
          "word": " very,",
          "start": 753.14,
          "end": 753.36,
          "speaker": "Gatut"
        },
        {
          "word": " very",
          "start": 753.46,
          "end": 753.66,
          "speaker": "Gatut"
        },
        {
          "word": " savage",
          "start": 753.72,
          "end": 755.16,
          "speaker": "Gatut"
        },
        {
          "word": " beast.",
          "start": 755.16,
          "end": 755.6,
          "speaker": "Gatut"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "But Hell is simply the absence of God.",
      "start": 756.6,
      "end": 759.1,
      "speaker": "Gatut",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " But",
          "start": 756.6,
          "end": 756.6,
          "speaker": "Gatut"
        },
        {
