          "end": 758.8,
          "speaker": "Gatut"
        },
        {
          "word": " God.",
          "start": 758.8,
          "end": 759.1,
          "speaker": "Gatut"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In other words, these people cannot stand to become close to God because they did not develop",
