          "speaker": "Gatut"
        },
        {
          "word": " service.",
          "start": 1411.5,
          "end": 1412.05,
          "speaker": "Gatut"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The animals, the metals, the minerals, the fuel that we can get, anything that we have in this earth is actually created by God for our service.",
