          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " does...",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " Dr.",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " Khalifa:",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " Douglas.",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Douglas.",
      "start": 3154.05,
      "end": 3154.05,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " Douglas.",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "One of the things we find in the Quran is God says \"those who believe and work righteousness.\" And that's the sequence.",
      "start": 3154.05,
      "end": 3154.05,
      "speaker": "Douglas",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " One",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " of",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " the",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " things",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " we",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " find",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " in",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " the",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " Quran",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " is",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " God",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " says",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " \"those",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " who",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " believe",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " and",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " work",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " righteousness.\"",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " And",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " that's",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " the",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " sequence.",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "You cannot work righteousness unless you believe.",
      "start": 3154.05,
      "end": 3154.05,
      "speaker": "Douglas",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " You",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " cannot",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " work",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " righteousness",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " unless",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " you",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " believe.",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A person can think they believe.",
      "start": 3154.05,
      "end": 3154.05,
      "speaker": "Douglas",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " A",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " person",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " can",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " think",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " they",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " believe.",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Quran says \"have you not seen those who follow their own opinions?\"",
      "start": 3154.05,
      "end": 3154.05,
      "speaker": "Douglas",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " The",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " Quran",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " says",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " \"have",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " you",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " not",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " seen",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " those",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " who",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " follow",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " their",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " own",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " opinions?\"",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Quran speaks of human beings who think they have guidance, who think they have knowledge, when in fact they don't.",
      "start": 3154.05,
      "end": 3154.05,
      "speaker": "Douglas",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " The",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " Quran",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " speaks",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " of",
