          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " don't.",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And all of us have at one time or another felt we know something or we know what to do in a situation.",
