          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Gatut"
        },
        {
          "word": " ego.",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Gatut"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "If we cannot accept the word of God as it says in the Quran, .... Hamid: Everything you do consciously, it will count,",
