          "speaker": "Gatut"
        },
        {
          "word": " count,",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Gatut"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "good or bad, it will count against, for you or against you.",
      "start": 3154.05,
      "end": 3154.05,
      "speaker": "Hamid",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " good",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " or",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " bad,",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " it",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " will",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " count",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " against,",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " for",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " you",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " or",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " against",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " you.",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "It will credit it in you and nothing to your neighbor, not your brother or father.",
      "start": 3154.05,
      "end": 3154.05,
      "speaker": "Hamid",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " It",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " will",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " credit",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " it",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " in",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " you",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " and",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " nothing",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " to",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " your",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " neighbor,",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " not",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " your",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " brother",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " or",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " father.",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "It's your own account.",
      "start": 3154.05,
      "end": 3154.05,
      "speaker": "Hamid",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " It's",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " your",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " own",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " account.",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "But, if you don't do it unconsciously, there is no credit.",
      "start": 3154.05,
      "end": 3154.05,
      "speaker": "Hamid",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " But,",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " if",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " you",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " don't",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " do",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " it",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " unconsciously,",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " there",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " is",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " no",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " credit.",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "If I Pray, if I'm a good Muslim, because my father told me so, there is no credit for me.",
      "start": 3154.05,
      "end": 3154.05,
      "speaker": "Hamid",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " If",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " I",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " Pray,",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " if",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " I'm",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " a",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " good",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " Muslim,",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " because",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " my",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " father",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " told",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " me",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " so,",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " there",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " is",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " no",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " credit",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " for",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        },
        {
          "word": " me.",
          "start": 3154.05,
          "end": 3154.05,
          "speaker": "Hamid"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "But if I come to the senses that there is such a religion and tells you this, and...",
      "start": 3154.05,
      "end": 3154.05,
      "speaker": "Hamid",
